<title>INDIA: India June aluminium output 42,628 tonnes.</title>
<headline>India June aluminium output 42,628 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 42,628 tonnes of aluminium in June against a target of 45,374 tonnes, a government statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The country produced 131,454 tonnes of aluminium during April-June compared with 116,962 tonnes in the same period in 1996, the statement said.</p>
<p>It said the state-run National Aluminium Company Ltd exported 53,428 tonnes of alumina and 3,207 tonnes of aluminium in June, 1997.</p>
